      .stat-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; }\n        .stat-value.remaining { color: #d32f2f; } \n\n        .info-row { padding: 15px 25px; background: #fff5f5; font-size: 14px; color: #c62828; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #ffebee; font-weight: 500; }\n\n        .btn-container { text-align: center; margin: 35px 0; }\n        .btn-portal { background-color: #b71c1c; color: #ffffff !important; padding: 16px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; font-size: 15px; transition: background 0.3s; }\n        \n        .footer { background: #2d3e50; color: #fff; padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1yWAhY7_vZVJOVwyxZsgILoKd58_na516\" alt=\"ALIMIN Logo\">\n            <h1>LOMAS DEL MAR</h1>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"danger-badge\">\n                <span>🔴 AVISO DE MORA Y ATRASO</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"greeting\">¡Hola {{ $json.body.contact_name }}!</p>\n            <p>Tu cuota mensual del Lote <strong>#{{ $json.body.lot_number }}</strong> se encuentra vencida. Mantenemos un registro de <strong>{{ $json.body.dias_atraso }} días de atraso</strong>.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"progress-card\">\n                <div class=\"progress-header\">\n                    <span>Monto Total a Pagar:</span>\n                    <span class=\"amount-highlight\">${{ $json.body.total_a_pagar }}</span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"stat-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">Cuota Original</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-value\">${{ $json.body.monto_cuota }}</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n                        <span class=\"stat-label\">Multa e Intereses</span>\n                        <span class=\"stat-value remaining\">+${{ $json.body.interes_mora }}</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"info-row\">\n                    Corresponde a la Cuota Nº {{ $json.body.cuota_numero }}. Los intereses aumentan diariamente.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"btn-container\">\n                <a href=\"{{ $json.body.link_gestion_terreno }}\" class=\"btn-portal\">\n                    Pagar Deuda y Multa\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #888; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;\">\n                Evita la acumulación de más intereses regularizando tu pago lo antes posible directo en el portal.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p><strong>ALIMIN SPA</strong><br>Departamento de Cobranzas</p>\n            <p style=\"opacity: 0.6; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 10px;\">ID Operación: {{ $json.body.reservation_id }}</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
